  "description": "Part of the Axiom family. A web engine built on Axiom.ProtoStream: Core binds ports, admits and secures connections and runs modules; HTTP, WebSockets and your own protocols are modules that plug into Core's sockets.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
