  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: once-only settings move from the builder to option records (ServerOptions; Admission, Drain, Deny, MaxConnectionAge and ContentRoot leave IServerBuilder). Every option is a Setting<T>, a value or a Config.Key read from the LWSE configuration section, with [Options] records checked by a generator in this package, so a value stated twice does not compile and an unread key is refused at startup. Configured ports (Config.Port, Config.Ports), a typed module lifecycle, and exceptions that state their fault and whether a retry can succeed. Adopted connections: an adopt-only port (Listen(AdoptOnlyPort, ...)) binds nothing and serves streams the application dialled through the same admission, transports, protocol, observers and drain as accepted ones; LWSEServer.TryReserve decides admission before the dial, LWSEServer.AdoptAsync serves the stream; modules reach the same seam through ModuleBuildContext.Adoption.",
